Hi {Owner},

I build websites for independent pharmacies around {City}. {Business Name} has loyal reviews, but no site where a new customer can request a refill, move a prescription to you or book a vaccination.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: private refill and transfer requests, a vaccination clinic page with placeholders for your list, compounding, medication packaging, travel health and a front-shop catalogue with reserve-for-pickup. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes after closing?

